  "data": {
    "pack": "Chapter Approved 2026-2027",
    "summary": "Beginning in battle round 2, a friendly unit can start this [action](vsdata:core-rule/performing-actions) during your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase). Pick an **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** in range other than your **home objective**. It must have none of your **operation markers** in range. Any number of units can start, each with a different **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** that phase. If the unit controls its **[objective](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)** when your turn ends, choose from your **operation markers** and place one in its range.",
